  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV 29<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> Cost #1: Cost of the Power Rebuild\n\nCost #2: 5,000eb<br>\n<strong>Thermometer:</strong> Provides an large straight forward offensive upgrade with a managable downside.<br>\n<strong>Applies To:</strong> A Power Weapon Rebuild<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> Toaster</p>\n<p>Increase Critical Injury bonus damage of attacks made by this weapon by an addition 5 (total 10). However, unless the user of this weapon has at least 1 installation of Granted Muscle &amp; Bone Lace or a Linear Frame they gain the Torn Muslce Critical Injury whenever they fire the weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is Cost #2 only; Cost #1 is the cost of the Power Rebuild.</li>\n<li>Not automated. The Tech, Smart, and Power Rebuilds are Corgo's 77 weapon mods.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Invented Tech Upgrades).</em></p>"
